/**
 * useWeekDropdownOptions — Generate week options for Walmart mode dropdowns.
 *
 * This hook generates MenuOption[] from IFiscalWeekInfo[] based on the configured
 * scope (current FY, current+previous FY, rolling, months-based range, or specific year).
 *
 * Features:
 * - Week scope strategies: 'current', 'current+previous', 'rolling', 'months', or number (FY)
 * - Optional fiscal year section headers
 * - Cross-FY selection support (End Week can be ≥ Start Week even across FY boundary)
 * - Month-based range: Driven by minDate/maxDate (defaults: past 1 year, future 3 months)
 */
